{"id":"n71505-1-17","stage":1,"title":"앞쪽 · 前面","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71505-1-17-1","ko":"여기 뒤쪽에서는 무대가 잘 안 보이네.","zh":"这里后面看舞台不太清楚呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}},{"text":"뒤쪽에서는","meaning":"后面，后头，后部","explanation":"뒤쪽：后面，后头，后部；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"뒤쪽","audio":"/audio/464ac5d0424e6b596506.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66947","senseId":"1","lemma":"뒤쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뒤쪽에서는","audio":"/audio/54a4367e0a1fa94b8501.mp3"}},{"text":"무대가","meaning":"舞台","explanation":"무대：舞台；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"무대","audio":"/audio/64389d2db12c00f1176e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15524","senseId":"1","lemma":"무대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무대가","audio":"/audio/18cd49fb23df69406469.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，了不起地","explanation":"잘：很好地，了不起地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"8","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"보이네.","meaning":"可见，看得到","explanation":"보이다：可见，看得到；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"3","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chines